+## [0.3.3] - 2022-01-13
 
 ### Added
 - `vst.flavor` argument to  `vst()` to allow for invoking running updated regularization (sctransform v2, proposed in [Satija and Choudhary, 2021](https://doi.org/10.1101/2021.07.07.451498). See paper for details.
